AIQEP Equivalent

If IBM had asked a Quality Engineering scenario, the same prompt pattern would be:

Act as a Senior Software Quality Engineering Consultant.

Help me brainstorm five quality improvement strategies for reducing software defects in an Automotive ECU project.

Focus on Agile Scrum, Automotive SPICE, and ISO 26262.

Present the ideas as a numbered list and explain the advantages of each strategy.

