Act as a Product Marketing Manager for an AI software company.

Generate three LinkedIn posts announcing the launch of the AI Quality Engineering Platform (AIQEP).

Each post should include:
- An engaging headline
- A concise description of AIQEP's value
- A call-to-action encouraging professionals to explore the project
