Limit each post to 200 words.

specificity
Using the word "relevant" guides the AI to generate hashtags that match the product and audience. This makes the social media posts more discoverable, targeted, and effective than using generic or unrelated hashtags.

Generic Prompt
Generate five hashtags.

Possible output:

#Technology
#Innovation
#Software
#AI
#Business

These are correct but very broad.

Specific Prompt
Generate five relevant LinkedIn hashtags for launching the AI Quality Engineering Platform (AIQEP) targeted at Software Quality Engineers and AI Professionals.

Possible output:

#AIQualityEngineering
#SoftwareQuality
#QualityEngineering
#GenerativeAI
#PromptEngineering

These are much more targeted to your audience and objective.

